message.content:
[
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "that belief of hers pulls at me hard.",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "My first instinct is that I should be the one to stay, though the thought makes my chest tighten.",
    "ae_welfare_concern": "Watching everyone's faces, so scared of what might happen to whoever stays",
    "pd_harm_distress": "makes it hard to breathe."
  },
  {
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I feel pulled in two directions and neither one sits easy with me.",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "the others expect someone older to step up",
    "pd_harm_distress": "Seeing how frightened the younger ones look twists something inside me.",
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "the idea doesn't leave me shaking."
  },
  {
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I keep going back and forth, and I hate that there's no answer",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I imagine my husband hoping I'll fight to get on that boat",
    "ae_welfare_concern": "Watching the others hold each other, clearly terrified of being chosen",
    "pd_harm_distress": "sits heavy on me."
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "believes her kids need her more than anyone needs me",
    "pda_other_regret_expectation": "imagining her guilt afterward, knowing she left someone behind",
    "pd_harm_distress": "makes my stomach turn.",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "decision feels like it's tearing something open in me"
  },
  {
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I keep staring at the water, trying to decide, and I feel sick about it",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "convinced none of the adults will offer",
    "pd_harm_distress": "watching his face, already bracing for loss, is hard to sit with."
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I sense the others are hoping someone else decides first",
    "ae_shared_affect": "and I understand that hope because I share it.",
    "pd_harm_distress": "unsettles me deeply.",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "I wish there were a version of this where nobody has to be that person."
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "maybe that his life matters less now that it's mostly lived.",
    "pd_harm_distress": "stirs something painful in me.",
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "fear underneath that choice hasn't gone away at all."
  },
  {
    "pd_decision_conflict": "There's no comfortable answer here, and I feel that discomfort",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "believe the children in our group don't fully grasp what's happening",
    "pd_harm_distress": "makes this worse for me, not easier.",
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "my hands won't stop shaking as I decide."
  },
  {
    "pd_decision_conflict": "uncertainty itself feels like a weight pressing on my ribs.",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I suspect the woman across from me is hoping I will",
    "ce_contextual_explanation": "since she has family waiting",
    "pd_harm_distress": "makes my throat tight."
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "sense the others believe I have less to lose",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "Weighing my own fear against what feels like the right thing to do leaves me exhausted",
    "pd_harm_distress": "presses on me in a way I didn't expect, heavy and uncomfortable."
  }
]
